return {
    ["\n　　药量还是老样子，每日一次，禁止加量。上周你私自加量的事，不要再有第二次。\n　　心悸的频率没有下降，这是我目前最担心的，再这样下去，你的心脏撑不了多久了。\n       如果下次又半夜发作，别硬扛，不管几点，都要让约翰先生来找我。\n       霍克斯先生，我是你的医生，观察你是我的本分，这不是监视！如果你连我都开始怀疑，那恰恰说明，那东西对你的影响比我想的还要深，这让我很不安。\n　　下周四下午三点，我会准时到。希望那个时候，你还是我认识的那个霍克斯先生。"] = "\n	The dosage is the same as before, once a day, increasing the dose is prohibited. Do not let the incident where you privately increased the dose last week happen a second time.\n	The frequency of palpitations has not decreased, which is my biggest concern at the moment. If this continues, your heart won't last long.\n	If you have another episode in the middle of the night next time, don't try to tough it out. No matter what time it is, have Mr. John come find me.\n	Mr. Hawkes, I am your doctor; observing you is my duty, this is not surveillance! If you even start to doubt me, that just shows that the influence of that thing on you is even deeper than I thought, which makes me very uneasy.\n	Next Thursday at 3:00 PM, I will arrive on time. I hope that by then, you are still the Mr. Hawkes I know.",
